Package: eyeki
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Eye drop reminder daemon for Linux
 EyeKi is a lightweight daemon that reminds users to use eye drops
 at configurable intervals. It detects user idle time via systemd-logind
 and supports both notification and full-screen popup modes.
 .
 Features:
  - Configurable reminder intervals
  - Two display modes: notification or GTK popup
  - Wayland compatible
  - Systemd user service integration
